# Install xCAT Provisioner

{% include "provisioner/provisioner.md.j2" %}

This guide covers both xCAT provisioning modes -- **stateless** (*netboot*),
where compute nodes boot a RAM-resident image served by the head node, and
**stateful** (*diskful*), where a base OS is installed onto each node's local
disk and OpenHPC components are added afterwards. The sections up to and
including *Identify Files for Synchronization* apply to both; after that,
follow the one section that matches the mode selected below and skip the other.

