## Stateless Provisioning

Follow this section when `${xcat_mode}` is `0`. The compute image is
assembled in a chroot on the head node; the nodes themselves do not boot until
the *Deploy Cluster* chapter. Skip ahead to *Stateful Provisioning* if you are
provisioning to local disk.

